{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> PLAYNESE: Master Japanese</strong> is a relaxing JRPG where you <i>learn Japanese by playing</i>.\u00a0It aims to teach Japanese from absolute beginner to mastery, all within a school setting, and natural, open-world gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a fantasy world, battle with Japanese cards, and study at your own pace, from absolute beginner to JLPT N1 preparation. Choose your level and start learning Japanese while having fun!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/0c532aadcb49be0e6b8f5a7c74f8483b.avif?t=1766283560\" width=400 height=90 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Some Key Features Include</strong></u><strong>:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbCover <strong>2,500 kanji</strong> with mnemonics, writing practice, and readings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb<strong>Hiragana &amp; Katakana</strong> with mnemonics, writing, and pronunciation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbAn <strong>in-game school</strong> with classrooms where you can read, listen to music, study kanji, take tests and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb<strong>Rooms full of books</strong>, from beginner to advanced, that you can read with narration and quizzes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb<strong>Language test practice</strong> with quizzes and clear explanations. (Like for the JLPT Tests)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<u><strong>The Study-Play Game Loop</strong></u><strong>:\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1\ufe0f\u20e3 Learn Japanese to earn money. [All Levels Welcome]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2\ufe0f\u20e3<strong>\u00a0</strong>Buy powerful cards and items, then battle creatures of a mad scientist.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3\ufe0f\u20e3 \ud83d\udd28Craft, \ud83d\udcb1Trade, \ud83c\udfa3Fish and \ud83c\udf3eHarvest resources.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/5fe017a561c4f39112e5271031b86628.avif?t=1766283560\" width=400 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0\u30fb<strong>PLAYNESE</strong> is a deeply in-depth adventure where you\u2019ll have to explore, experiment, and uncover secrets in a constantly growing Open World \ud83c\udf0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Absorb Japanese naturally while having fun</u>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/6cd88aea67056117c52325f5d822218d.avif?t=1766283560\" width=400 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbTrack your Japanese progress and earn Japanese yen (\u5186) as you go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/289c7768c74653aa5395ffa13de57cc0.avif?t=1766283560\" width=576 height=324 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb<u>EARLY ACCESS</u>: Constant Updates filled with <u>Language and Adventure</u> :)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u307e\u305f\u306d\uff01\uff3c\uff08\uff3e\u25cb\uff3e\uff09\u4eba\uff08\uff3e\u25cb\uff3e\uff09\uff0f</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3764890/extras/ec5e124fdeeb91138ca38f966ab5f6da.avif?t=1766283560\" width=308 height=461 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3764890?t=1766283560","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3764890?t=1766283560","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as